s=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, October to November is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Barnwell County, and it came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 that pair landed at 51% of normal on the middle, and November to December at 48%. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 27% of normal on the middle. All 7 grids had their driest year in 1954, with grid 16095 and grid 16096 down to 58%.</p>"}
